sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant FundingInvoiceController
    participant FundingInvoiceService
    participant FundingBatchRepository
    participant SubaccountRepository
    participant Database

    Client->>+FundingInvoiceController: POST /api/v1/funding-invoices/batch
    FundingInvoiceController->>FundingInvoiceController: Validate cashInOutId not empty
    FundingInvoiceController->>FundingInvoiceController: Validate subaccount list not empty
    FundingInvoiceController->>+FundingInvoiceService: CreateBatchInvoicesAsync(dto)
    loop For each subaccountId
        FundingInvoiceService->>+SubaccountRepository: GetByIdAsync(subaccountId)
        SubaccountRepository-->>-FundingInvoiceService: Subaccount entity
        FundingInvoiceService->>+Database: INSERT FundingInvoice
        Database-->>-FundingInvoiceService: invoiceId
    end
    FundingInvoiceService-->>-FundingInvoiceController: BatchInvoiceResultDto (success/failure counts)
    FundingInvoiceController-->>-Client: 201 Created { successCount, failureCount, failedSubaccounts }
